{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"elf_longbow_ranger","model_identifier":"elf_longbow_ranger","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# elf_longbow_ranger\n\nElf longbow ranger (A3), elite archer, 1.9 m = 68 u (hood to 70).\n\nElf archer in a grey-green hooded cloak with leaf-cut edges (the pointed ears poke out through slits in the hood), short robe-coat, leggings and soft boots, bracer on the bow arm. Longbow about 1.8 m, taller than the shoulder; back quiver of steel-tipped, white-fletched arrows. Can shoot while walking (walk_shoot). Baseline skeleton and slot names.\n\n- Cubes: 38 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -9.0..8.5, y 0.0..69.8, z -6.0..5.2 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 16 x 70 x 12 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `shoot` | 1.4 | once | key 0.90 s: arrow leaves the string (raise, full draw by 0.77 s, short hold, loose) |\n| `idle` | 4 | loop | bow lowered in the left hand |\n| `walk` | 1 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.6 | loop |  |\n| `walk_shoot` | 2 | loop | loop 2.0 s, key 1.1875 s: arrow leaves the string; legs walk throughout, then the right hand fetches a new arrow from the back quiver and re-nocks (one shot per loop) |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | flinch from the front |\n| `death` | 1.3 | hold | falls on the back, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 53.3 u/s (1.50 m/s), cycle 1.0 s\n- `run`: 177.8 u/s (5.00 m/s), cycle 0.6 s\n- `walk_shoot`: 35.6 u/s (1.00 m/s), 2 strides per loop (2.0 s)\n\n## Key times\n\n- `shoot`: key 0.90 s: arrow leaves the string (raise, full draw by 0.77 s, short hold, loose)\n- `walk_shoot`: loop 2.0 s, key 1.1875 s: arrow leaves the string; legs walk throughout, then the right hand fetches a new arrow from the back quiver and re-nocks (one shot per loop)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 68, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 47.5, 4)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (2.5, 51.5, 4)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (4, 57.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 45.5, -4)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (7, 30.5, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-10, 38.5, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-7, 30.5, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (5.5, 37, 2)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-5.5, 37, 2)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `longbow` (visible, under slot_hand_l): about 1.8 m (64 u), grip at the origin, limbs along Z, string on the +Y side\n- `quiver` (visible, under slot_quiver): back quiver, arrows with steel tips (inside) and white fletching\n\n## Variant textures (same UV layout)\n\n- `elf_longbow_ranger_silver.png`: silver brows/hair\n- `elf_longbow_ranger_gold.png`: pale gold\n- `elf_longbow_ranger_black.png`: black (only the brows and hair line show under the hood)\n\n## Notes\n\n- No arrow is modelled on the string; spawn the projectile at slot_hand_r / the bow at the key time.\n- walk_shoot: drive root forward at the walk_shoot speed; the feet are planted for that speed.\n"},"description":"# elf_longbow_ranger\n\nElf longbow ranger (A3), elite archer, 1.9 m = 68 u (hood to 70).\n\nElf archer in a grey-green hooded cloak with leaf-cut edges (the pointed ears poke out through slits in the hood), short robe-coat, leggings and soft boots, bracer on the bow arm. Longbow about 1.8 m, taller than the shoulder; back quiver of steel-tipped, white-fletched arrows. Can shoot while walking (walk_shoot). Baseline skeleton and slot names.\n\n- Cubes: 38 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -9.0..8.5, y 0.0..69.8, z -6.0..5.2 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 16 x 70 x 12 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `shoot` | 1.4 | once | key 0.90 s: arrow leaves the string (raise, full draw by 0.77 s, short hold, loose) |\n| `idle` | 4 | loop | bow lowered in the left hand |\n| `walk` | 1 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.6 | loop |  |\n| `walk_shoot` | 2 | loop | loop 2.0 s, key 1.1875 s: arrow leaves the string; legs walk throughout, then the right hand fetches a new arrow from the back quiver and re-nocks (one shot per loop) |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | flinch from the front |\n| `death` | 1.3 | hold | falls on the back, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 53.3 u/s (1.50 m/s), cycle 1.0 s\n- `run`: 177.8 u/s (5.00 m/s), cycle 0.6 s\n- `walk_shoot`: 35.6 u/s (1.00 m/s), 2 strides per loop (2.0 s)\n\n## Key times\n\n- `shoot`: key 0.90 s: arrow leaves the string (raise, full draw by 0.77 s, short hold, loose)\n- `walk_shoot`: loop 2.0 s, key 1.1875 s: arrow leaves the string; legs walk throughout, then the right hand fetches a new arrow from the back quiver and re-nocks (one shot per loop)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 68, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 47.5, 4)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (2.5, 51.5, 4)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (4, 57.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 45.5, -4)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (7, 30.5, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-10, 38.5, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-7, 30.5, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (5.5, 37, 2)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-5.5, 37, 2)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `longbow` (visible, under slot_hand_l): about 1.8 m (64 u), grip at the origin, limbs along Z, string on the +Y side\n- `quiver` (visible, under slot_quiver): back quiver, arrows with steel tips (inside) and white fletching\n\n## Variant textures (same UV layout)\n\n- `elf_longbow_ranger_silver.png`: silver brows/hair\n- `elf_longbow_ranger_gold.png`: pale gold\n- `elf_longbow_ranger_black.png`: black (only the brows and hair line show under the hood)\n\n## Notes\n\n- No arrow is modelled on the string; spawn the projectile at slot_hand_r / the bow at the key time.\n- walk_shoot: drive root forward at the walk_shoot speed; the feet are planted for that speed.\n","resolution":{"width":128,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"pelvis","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-4.5,34.0,-2.5],"to":[4.5,38.0,2.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,34.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[11,96,20.0,100.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[43,96,48.0,100.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[20,96,29.0,100.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[48,96,53.0,100.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[73,89,82.0,94.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[82,89,91.0,94.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"034453a6-0693-5ecd-b4d9-6db9d9f8c15f"},{"name":"chest","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-5.5,38.0,-2.5],"to":[5.5,56.0,2.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,38.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[32,0,43.0,18.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[54,0,59.0,18.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[43,0,54.0,18.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[59,0,64.0,18.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[51,89,62.0,94.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[62,89,73.0,94.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"f2b94352-8e73-52f1-82b0-4f5dc08c2d0d"},{"name":"neck","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-1.5,56.0,-1.5],"to":[1.5,60.0,1.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,56.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[85,96,88.0,100.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[88,96,91.0,100.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[91,96,94.0,100.0],"texture":0},"we